OL,3,GNEWSAEvery Halloween a painful reminder
OL,4,Aof the grandmother who vanished
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe posters advertising Halloween
OL,7,Fparties at Coastfields Holiday Village,
OL,8,FIngoldmells, bring memories rushing
OL,9,Fback for Jo Hill and Stephanie Barwell.
OL,11,FThe last time they saw Anne Simpson,
OL,12,FJo's mother and Stephanie's
OL,13,Fgrandmother, was 26 September 2004 at
OL,14,Fher new caravan on the site.
OL,16,FThey made plans to come back for a
OL,17,Ffamily gathering for a Halloween party.
OL,19,FBut the next day Jo, 62, received a
OL,20,Fphone call telling her that Anne was
OL,21,Fmissing.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
